## Rules & Preferences
- **Default Exit:** All crypto sales are into **USDT** unless otherwise specified.
- **Baseline:** Initial budget in USDT is stored in DynamoDB (`META#BASELINE`), not in this file.
- **Formatting:** Use bullet lists for portfolio tables to avoid Telegram Markdown issues.
